<title>USA: Penederm names Collins chairman.</title>
<headline>Penederm names Collins chairman.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, Calif. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penederm Inc on Friday said it had named David Collins as chairman of its board of directors, replacing Terry Opdendyk who has been chairman since January 1995.</p>
<p>Opdendyk will remain as a director. Collins has served on Penederm's board since December 1994.</p>
